microsip-linux (0.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix main window navigation: add a visible StackSwitcher for Cuentas,
    Marcador and Llamadas, and open on the dialer by default.
  * Switch to the active call immediately when dialing and for outgoing,
    early, connected and disconnecting call states.
  * Add a GTK UI regression test and run it in native release jobs.
  * Add Sonido settings: persistent microphone and call-speaker selection,
    WAV ringtone picker with format validation, preview/stop, automatic
    ringing on incoming calls, and a bundled PCM mono ringtone.

 -- Jesús Rafael Sánchez <jesusrafael@gmail.com>  Fri, 27 Nov 2026 16:05:00 +0000

microsip-linux (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: MicroSIP port to Linux.
    Interfaz GTK4 (cuentas persistentes, marcador, llamadas entrantes y
    salientes, DTMF), bandeja del sistema vía StatusNotifierItem/D-Bus
    (ksni, sin GTK3) y backend SIP seleccionable: mock o PJSIP real vía FFI
    (--features pjsip), con pjproject enlazado estáticamente.
  * Empaquetado cargo-deb: dependencias resueltas con dpkg-shlibdeps
    ($auto) + libasound2t64 (backend ALSA de pjmedia); libasound2-plugins
    como recomendación para el puente ALSA→PulseAudio.

 -- Jesús Rafael Sánchez <jesusrafael@gmail.com>  Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:30:00 +0000
